title: "SPTB: A Structural Spline-Penalized Tail Bound for L-Functions"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-10-16
url: "https://github.com/aakbarie/SPTB-RiemannHypothesis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aakbarie/SPTB-RiemannHypothesis"
keywords:
  - Riemann Hypothesis
  - L-functions
  - spline approximation
  - numerical analysis
  - analytic number theory
license: MIT
abstract: >
  The Spline-Penalized Tail Bound measures the residual after fitting affine functions on short intervals. The numerical experiments use tabulated zero ordinates and synthetic off-line zeros. The proposed detection criterion for the full zero spectrum requires a bound on cancellation between modes.
